OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds return at bus firm as pay
OL,4,Adeal ends strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of workers at a bus
OL,7,Fmanufacturer have ended strike action
OL,8,Fafter securing an above-inflation pay
OL,9,Fdeal.
OL,11,FAbout 400 staff members in the Unite
OL,12,Funion at Alexander Dennis in
OL,13,FScarborough had walked out in June
OL,14,Fafter rejecting management's offer of a
OL,15,F4% increase. Nationally, CPI inflation
OL,16,Fwas 3.1% in the year to August 2026.
OL,18,FThe workers have now accepted a 4.5%
OL,19,Frise, back-dated to January, with a
OL,20,Ffurther 3.5% increase in January 2027,
OL,21,Fthe union said.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
