OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds return at bus firm as pay
OL,4,Adeal ends strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Alexander Dennis
OL,7,Fsaid an agreement had been reached that
OL,8,F"enables us to resume full
OL,9,Fmanufacturing operations at our
OL,10,FScarborough site and continue to
OL,11,Fdeliver for our customers".
